  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Faculty Exchange Program - Ukrainian Economics Fellows</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Faculty Exchange Program enhances the teaching ability of agricultural educators from institutions of higher learning in developing countries. Participants come to the United States for one academic semester (4-5 months) to increase their knowledge of, and ability to teach, agricultural economics, marketing, business and law in a market-based economy.</narrative>
  </description>
